---

## ✨ Features
- **🎯 Role-Specific Prep:** Generates questions based on the specific job title you are targeting.
- **⚡ Real-time AI Chat:** Natural language processing to simulate a back-and-forth interview.
- **📊 Performance Insights:** Get a summary of your performance and suggested improvements.
- **📱 Responsive UI:** Practice on your phone or desktop.

---

## 🧠 How It Works
1. **Input:** The user enters the job role and description.
2. **Processing:** The app sends a structured prompt to the AI (Gemini/OpenAI).
3. **Simulation:** The AI generates a series of technical and behavioral questions.
4. **Feedback:** Your responses are analyzed for keywords and sentiment.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React (Hooks, Context API)
- **Build Tool:** Vite
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS
- **AI Integration:** Google Gemini API / OpenAI API
- **State Management:** LocalStorage for session persistence

